\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Santa%27s_Workshop\" title=\"Santa&#39;s Workshop\">Santa's Workshop</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">❅75,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plays Minigame/Simulator</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Arcade Machine</b> is from the <a href=\"/wiki/Gift_of_Golden_Times\" title=\"Gift of Golden Times\">Gift of Golden Times</a>, it plays a minigame based on Cookie Clicker, where instead of clicking to earn cookies, you earn logs.\n</p><p>You can use these logs to buy <b>two</b> powerups, the <b>lumberjack</b> and the <b>handsaw</b>.\n</p>\n<ul><li>From the <b>beginning</b>, the lumberjack costs <b>15 logs</b>, gives <b>one log per chop</b>, and drops a raw log on screen.</li>\n<li>From the <b>beginning</b>, the handsaw costs <b>35 logs</b>, giving <b>two logs per chop</b> which drops a sanded log on screen.</li>\n<li>A <b>gift</b> can drop at any point, <b>increasing</b> the logs given and the speed. It also enables an <b>ice effect</b> on the screen, dropping <b>ice logs.</b></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>The Arcade Machine only comes in a light red and maroon color, with only a red button and a black screen\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903024558\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 62/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 52/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019450/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   59.659      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   59.659      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3738-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903024558 and revision id 16745. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories"